      "q": "How much does General Dynamics Land Systems make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "General Dynamics Land Systems has $1.8B in contract obligations for FY2026 to date. General Dynamics Land Systems recorded 369 awards and an average award size of $4.7M, and obligations are up 14.8% year over year. General Dynamics Land Systems' fiscal-year obligations have ranged from $2.5B in FY21 to $4B in FY22, then declined to $1.5B in FY25 before the current FY26 partial total of $1.8B."
